                        <a href="#apply" class="px-8 py-4 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md text-white border border-white/20 rounded-2xl font-black text-sm uppercase tracking-widest transition-all duration-300 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 hover:-translate-y-1">
